    enonce: "<span class=\"q\">1) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = a - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span></span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = -1 - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span> + a</span><br><span class=\"q\">2) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = a - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span></span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">F = b - 7</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">F = 4 - (a + 3 - b) + (-8 + a)</span><br><span class=\"q\">3) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = a - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span></span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">F = b - 7</span> احسب <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E</span> في حالة <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span></span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = -1 - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span> + a</span><br><span class=\"q\">4) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = a - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span></span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">F = b - 7</span> احسب <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E</span> في حالة <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span></span> أوجد <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b</span> علما و أنّ <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">F = -2</span> و <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">F = b - 7</span>",
