    enonce: "<span class=\"q\">1) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = a - b + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"den\">8</span></span></span> حيث <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"den\">8</span></span> - [-a + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"den\">3</span></span> - <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span>] + (-b + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"den\">3</span></span>)</span><br><span class=\"q\">2) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = a - b + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"den\">8</span></span></span> حيث احسب <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E</span> علما و أنّ <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a - b = -5</span> و <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = a - b + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"den\">8</span></span></span><br><span class=\"q\">3) </span>بيّن أنّ: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = a - b + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"den\">8</span></span></span> حيث احسب <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E</span> علما و أنّ <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a - b = -5</span> و قارن a و b إذا كان <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = 0</span> <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">E = a - b + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"den\">8</span></span></span>",
